[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167550603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109419#issuecomment-3167550603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109419","id":3167550603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68zPyL","user":{"login":"F3der1co","id":89512047,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTEyMDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89512047?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co","html_url":"https://github.com/F3der1co","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T11:26:49Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T11:26:49Z","body":"Thanks for the review, made the suggested changes!\r\nImo regardless if https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106018 gets merged or not, we still need this, as 0-1 is not enough range to have meanigful control over the damping with Jolts implementation. The case were I encounter this issue is cloth physics, I need to go to 10-15 damping coefficient to get a desirable result with Jolt, otherwise it's moving too erratically. So to me it still makes sense to also increase the range, 10000 was a bit much, maybe 0-100 would be better.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167550603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167610685","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109419#issuecomment-3167610685","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109419","id":3167610685,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68zec9","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T11:51:14Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T11:53:21Z","body":"> 0-1 is not enough range to have meanigful control over the damping with Jolts implementation\r\n\r\nThe problem is that Jolt is not the default 3D physics engine just yet, and anything above 1 is problematic with Godot Physics, as you'll start to flip the velocity.\r\n\r\nOnce Jolt becomes the default 3D physics engine then we can change this to be 0 to 100 or something, like it is for `RigidBody3D`, but until then I suggest we keep 0 to 1 and use `or_greater` to accommodate for people using Jolt.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167610685/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167631337","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109419#issuecomment-3167631337","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109419","id":3167631337,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68zjfp","user":{"login":"F3der1co","id":89512047,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NTEyMDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89512047?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co","html_url":"https://github.com/F3der1co","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/F3der1co/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T11:57:46Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T11:57:46Z","body":"makes sense, than this is a good stopgap.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167631337/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168810534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109419#issuecomment-31688105